n integral part of our biochemistry department.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"His groundbreaking research on protein structures and functions was instrumental in advancing our understanding of biological systems.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"A review of Song's publication history reveals a plethora of research papers co-authored with Yonsei University faculty members, including a seminal study on enzyme kinetics published in the Journal of Biological Chemistry in 2015.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"Data from the university's website and academic databases confirms Song's affiliation with Yonsei University, with records showing his involvement in various research projects and academic programs between 2010 and 2018.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"Kiwon Song's contributions to the field of biochemistry are undeniable, and his association with Yonsei University is a testament to the institution's commitment to fostering innovative research,\\\" said Dr.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"Sung-Hoon Kim, Dean of the College of Life Science and Biotechnology at Yonsei University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Our investigation has also uncovered evidence of Song's participation in international conferences and workshops hosted by Yonsei University, including the 2017 International Symposium on Biochemistry and Molecular Biology.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Kiwon Song did, in fact, work for Yonsei University, further cementing the institution's reputation as a bastion of scientific excellence.\"}]}"
